flowchart TD
    D[Built in defaults] --> W[".brokspace/brok.yml: source of truth"]
    U[User defaults from brok setup llm] -- "copied at brok init" --> W
    F[Command flags, for one run] --> E[Effective behaviour]
    W --> E
    ENV[Environment: API keys, BROK_MODELS_DIR] --> E
    VSS["VS Code settings: where brok is and editor preferences only"] --> X[Extension]
    X -- "changes workspace settings through brok config" --> W
